# vi operators: d, c, y with motions and counts; dd/cc/yy; D C Y; x X
# s S r ~ p P.
tags: vi
--- inputrc
set editing-mode vi
set keyseq-timeout 50
--- script
readline "> "

=== dw
tags: vi-delete-to
keys: one two three\e<pause>0dw<dump>\r

=== dw-at-last-word
tags: vi-delete-to
keys: one two\e<pause>0wdw<dump>\r

=== dW
tags: vi-delete-to
keys: a.b c.d e\e<pause>0dW<dump>\r

