=== tilde
tags: vi-change-case
keys: hello\e<pause>0~<dump>~~<dump>\r

=== tilde-count
tags: vi-change-case numarg
keys: hello World\e<pause>08~<dump>\r

=== tilde-non-letters
tags: vi-change-case
keys: a1-B\e<pause>0~~~~<dump>\r

=== tilde-utf8
tags: vi-change-case utf8
