=== tilde-at-end
tags: vi-change-case
keys: ab\e<pause>~<dump>\r

=== underscore-yank-arg
tags: vi-yank-arg
--- script
add_history "cmd alpha beta"
readline "> "
--- keys
x \e<pause>_<dump>\r

=== underscore-yank-arg-count
tags: vi-yank-arg numarg
--- script
add_history "cmd alpha beta"
readline "> "
--- keys
x \e<pause>1_<dump>\r

=== vi-yank-pop
tags: vi-yank-pop
--- inputrc
set editing-mode vi
set keyseq-timeout 50
set keymap vi-command
"\C-y": vi-yank-pop
--- keys
aa\e<pause>dd<pause>abb\e<pause>dd<pause>p<dump>\C-y<dump>\r

=== vi-delete-to-api
tags: vi-delete-to api
--- script
def d
rl_vi_delete_to 1 "d"
end
defun del d
rl_bind_keyseq_in_map "\C-x" del vi-command
readline "> "
--- keys
one two\e<pause>0\C-xw<dump>\r


=== vi-bracktype-api
tags: rl_vi_bracktype api
--- script
rl_vi_bracktype "("
rl_vi_bracktype ")"
rl_vi_bracktype "["
rl_vi_bracktype "]"
rl_vi_bracktype "{"
rl_vi_bracktype "}"
rl_vi_bracktype "x"

=== vi-check-api
tags: rl_vi_check api
--- script
def c
rl_vi_check
dump
end
defun chk c
rl_bind_keyseq_in_map "\C-x" chk vi-insert
readline "> "
--- keys
abc\C-x\r
